 race on the shores of Narragansett Bay\, with coastal views and a fast\, f
 lat course. An Ocean State Running Tradition. Join us for a beautiful\, oc
 ean-side race in our little seaside community. Strictly limited to just 40
 0 runners. Presented by the fine folks Foundation Performance Sports Medic
 ine.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/colt-state-park-hal
 f-marathon/112489/
