BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dia de los Muertos Community Ofrenda in Providence
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261101T165532Z
UID:177fb09ae5a5689bbfa5e663dda7@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:New England Donor Services (NEDS) will partner with Rhode Isla
 nd Latino Arts (RILA) for Day of the Dead (“Día de los Muertos”) cele
 brations on Sunday\, November 1st at the Southside Cultural Center in Prov
 idence. This free\, public event from 5:30 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. ET will featu
 re a display of a traditional community ofrenda (altar) honoring deceased 
 loved ones. NEDS will present an ofrenda with a photo collage of organ don
 ors to pay tribute to those who have given the gift of life through organ 
 donation\, while also raising awareness about the vital need for organ don
 ors. The event will feature: Ingrid Palacios\, Senior Multicultural Progra
 m Manager at New England Donor Services and Done Vida New England Marta V.
  Martinez\, Executive Director of Rhode Island Latino Arts (RILA) Local ar
 tists and performers Donor families and transplant recipients\n\nSource: h
 ttps://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-community-ofrenda
 -in-providence/112408/
LOCATION:Southside Cultural Center\, 393 Broad Street\, Providence\, 02907
  Time: 5:30 PM to 7:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-community-of
 renda-in-providence/112408/
END:VEVENT
